      "text": "Generalized volume conjecture and the A-polynomials: the Neumann-Zagier potential function as a classical limit of quantum invariant — 9 sections: Front matter; Quantum Dilogarithm Function; Examples\n\n**Generalized volume conjecture and the A-polynomials: the Neumann-Zagier potential function as a classical limit of quantum invariant**\n\n*QUANTUM INVARIANT*\n\n58 pp, 9 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Quantum Dilogarithm Function; Examples; Figure-Eight knot 41; 52; Pretzel knot (-2,3,7); Once-Punctured Torus Bundles over the Circle; Complement of Knots up to 7 Crossings; Complement of ``Simple'' Hyperbolic Knots",
